      "content": "psychosomatic feedback? thats a weird way to put it. it felt much more... external than that. like the air actually got heavy right before the lights went out. honestly it's getting kind of scary because i dont want to cause a scene or break anything at the office. do u have any ideas on how i can stabilize my aura or whatever it is so i dont keep causing these disruptions?",
